      "content": "Here are a few punchy bios to give your gritty city life some texture. Consider \"Silas,\" a weaselly bookie who always smells faintly of stale cigarettes, keeping tabs on every desperate low-stakes bet. Introduce \"Mabel,\" a sharp-tongued diner waitress who sees everything but stays silent, trading secrets for a free refill. Then there's \"Rico,\" a twitchy courier who moves small, untraceable packages, always looking over his shoulder. These characters should feel like necessary, dangerous fixtures of your decaying metropolis.",
